  "notes": [
   "The single 'Degree and Certificate Student Learning Outcome' is shared by the A.S. degree and the Certificate of Achievement in Welding Technology; recorded here for the A.S.",
   "The first option says 'Complete 15 units from two of the course blocks below' (i.e., from two of the WELD 100, 101, 111, 112, 114 series); the two-series constraint cannot be encoded and should be checked.",
